 "purpose": "The device has a fault. Tell the owner a technician visit is booked to fix or swap it on the visit date in the time window. Until then customers can pay by scanning the printed QR. Apologise briefly for the trouble.",
 "facts": {
  "merchant": "Balakrishnan Snacks Corner",
  "owner_first_name": "Bakhshi",
  "language": "English",
  "device": "Soundbox",
  "visit_date": "Thu 19 Nov",
  "time_window": "10:00 to 13:00"
 },
 "policy_section": {
  "ref": "Retention playbook §3.1",
  "text": "Retention playbook §3.1 Device issues: Soundbox swap via technician\n\n**3.1 Soundbox swap via technician.** Book a technician when the Soundbox shows a hardware fault, or has been offline for more than a day while the network is healthy and a remote reset (§3.2) has failed.\n- Book the visit and send the merchant a WhatsApp update with the date and time window. The agent does this alone.\n- Keep the ticket open until uptime has held for 2 days after the swap, then close it and tell the merchant.\n- Do not pause Grow eligibility longer than needed. Once the device is fixed and the case closed, §1.1 no longer applies."
 }
}
